<div id="A2.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A2.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We report the performance of our method on the autonomous driving benchmark nuScenes in Table <a href="#A2.T8" title="Table 8 ‣ B.1 Additional results on autonomous driving ‣ Appendix B Additional Experiment ‣ Embodied Navigation Foundation Model" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">8</span></a>. We compare our method with strong baselines that are specifically designed for autonomous driving. Nevertheless, our method achieves comparable performance to these methods without explicitly modeling driving-related information.</p>
</div>
